# Ready-to-run requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client).
# Create a key first:  docker compose exec api python -m app.cli api-key create --name demo --role admin
@base = http://localhost:8000
@key = cg_REPLACE_ME
@document = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@extraction = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@issue = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@run = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Liveness / readiness (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health/live

###
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Upload (multipart; replay-safe with Idempotency-Key)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-upload-0001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../tests/fixtures/generated/digital_invoice.pdf
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="ledger.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../tests/fixtures/generated/invoices.xlsx
--boundary--

### List: needs review, from one supplier, highest total first
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents?status=needs_review&supplier=acme&sort=total&order=desc&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Detail + progress (send the ETag back as If-None-Match to get 304)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Processing history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}/events?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Results: fields with evidence, line items, issues, reconciliations
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Original file
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}/file
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Page preview
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}/units/0/image?dpi=110
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Correct fields (If-Match = lock_version from the extraction)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/extractions/{{extraction}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
If-Match: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"fields": {"total": "270.00", "invoice_date": "2024-03-05"}, "reason": "OCR misread"}

### Correction history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/extractions/{{extraction}}/corrections
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Resolve an issue
POST {{base}}/api/v1/issues/{{issue}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "Checked against the paper original"}

### Approve (409 while unresolved errors remain)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/extractions/{{extraction}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "Looks right"}

### Reject (note required)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/extractions/{{extraction}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "Not one of our suppliers"}

### Reprocess from the LLM stage
POST {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}/reprocess
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_stage": "extract", "force": false}

### Bulk reprocess failed documents (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/jobs/reprocess-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"error_codes": ["LLM_ERROR", "WORKER_TIMEOUT"], "limit": 100}

### Batch reconciliation: PDFs vs a ledger
POST {{base}}/api/v1/reconciliations
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"left_document_ids": ["{{document}}"], "right_document_ids": ["{{document}}"]}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reconciliations/{{run}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Keyword search with filters
GET {{base}}/api/v1/search?q=INV-2024&has_open_issues=true
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Stats (admin)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Delete (admin, soft)
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/documents/{{document}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
